{
  "_comment": [
    "The video graph, in the shape the workflow that produced the first outputs",
    "used (read back out of MiniMax_H3_0000*.mp4's embedded `prompt`).  Same",
    "rules as universal.json: nodes are addressed by `painter_role`, never by id.",
    "",
    "One template covers both modes.  IMAGE-TO-VIDEO is what is written here:",
    "the dropped image is scaled to the pixel budget and the frame size comes",
    "back OUT of it (GetImageSize), which is why the aspect controls disappear",
    "in that mode -- the image decides.  TEXT-TO-VIDEO drops `load_image`,",
    "`scale_image` and `image_size` (registry._build_video) and feeds the width",
    "and height painter computed from aspect + MP straight into `video`.",
    "",
    "`load_image_last` is the OPTIONAL frame to end on: the node's `last_frame`",
    "input, wired only when one was dropped and the node dropped otherwise (an",
    "unwired LoadImage with an empty filename fails Comfy's own validation).",
    "",
    "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo is conditioning (0) AND latent (1) in one node, and",
    "it takes the prompt itself -- there is no CLIPTextEncode and no negative",
    "prompt to encode, so the negative box is hidden for this family rather",
    "than sent somewhere it would do nothing.  BasicGuider takes no CFG for the",
    "same reason.",
    "",
    "The audio VAE is not optional: the model emits video and audio latents",
    "together and CreateVideo muxes both."
  ],
  "1": {
    "inputs": { "unet_name": "", "weight_dtype": "default" },
    "class_type": "UNETLoader",
    "_meta": { "title": "Load Diffusion Model", "painter_role": "loader" }
  },
  "2": {
    "inputs": { "clip_name": "", "type": "minimax", "device": "default" },
    "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
    "_meta": { "title": "Load CLIP", "painter_role": "clip" }
  },
  "3": {
    "inputs": { "vae_name": "" },
    "class_type": "VAELoader",
    "_meta": { "title": "Load VAE (video)", "painter_role": "vae" }
  },
  "4": {
    "inputs": { "vae_name": "" },
    "class_type": "VAELoader",
    "_meta": { "title": "Load VAE (audio)", "painter_role": "vae_audio" }
  },
  "10": {
    "inputs": { "image": "" },
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "_meta": { "title": "Load Image", "painter_role": "load_image" }
  },
  "13": {
    "inputs": { "image": "" },
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "_meta": { "title": "Load Image (last frame)", "painter_role": "load_image_last" }
  },
  "11": {
    "inputs": {
      "upscale_method": "nearest-exact",
      "megapixels": 0.3,
      "resolution_steps": 32,
      "image": ["10", 0]
    },
    "class_type": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels",
    "_meta": { "title": "Scale Image to Total Pixels", "painter_role": "scale_image" }
  },
  "12": {
    "inputs": { "image": ["11", 0] },
    "class_type": "GetImageSize",
    "_meta": { "title": "Get Image Size", "painter_role": "image_size" }
  },
  "20": {
    "inputs": {
      "prompt": "",
      "width": ["12", 0],
      "height": ["12", 1],
      "length": 124,
      "clip": ["2", 0],
      "vae": ["3", 0],
      "first_frame": ["10", 0]
    },
    "class_type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo",
    "_meta": { "title": "MiniMax H3 Image to Video", "painter_role": "video" }
  },
  "21": {
    "inputs": { "sampler_name": "res_multistep" },
    "class_type": "KSamplerSelect",
    "_meta": { "title": "Sampler", "painter_role": "sampler_select" }
  },
  "22": {
    "inputs": { "scheduler": "simple", "steps": 20, "denoise": 1.0, "model": ["1", 0] },
    "class_type": "BasicScheduler",
    "_meta": { "title": "Scheduler", "painter_role": "scheduler" }
  },
  "23": {
    "inputs": { "noise_seed": 0 },
    "class_type": "RandomNoise",
    "_meta": { "title": "Noise", "painter_role": "noise" }
  },
  "24": {
    "inputs": { "model": ["1", 0], "conditioning": ["20", 0] },
    "class_type": "BasicGuider",
    "_meta": { "title": "Guider", "painter_role": "guider" }
  },
  "25": {
    "inputs": {
      "noise": ["23", 0],
      "guider": ["24", 0],
      "sampler": ["21", 0],
      "sigmas": ["22", 0],
      "latent_image": ["20", 1]
    },
    "class_type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced",
    "_meta": { "title": "Sampler", "painter_role": "sampler" }
  },
  "30": {
    "inputs": { "samples": ["25", 0], "vae": ["3", 0] },
    "class_type": "VAEDecode",
    "_meta": { "title": "VAE Decode", "painter_role": "decode" }
  },
  "31": {
    "inputs": { "samples": ["25", 0], "vae": ["4", 0] },
    "class_type": "VAEDecodeAudio",
    "_meta": { "title": "VAE Decode Audio", "painter_role": "decode_audio" }
  },
  "32": {
    "inputs": { "fps": 24.0, "bit_depth": 8, "images": ["30", 0], "audio": ["31", 0] },
    "class_type": "CreateVideo",
    "_meta": { "title": "Create Video", "painter_role": "create_video" }
  },
  "33": {
    "inputs": {
      "filename_prefix": "video/painter",
      "format": "auto",
      "codec": "auto",
      "video": ["32", 0]
    },
    "class_type": "SaveVideo",
    "_meta": { "title": "Save Video", "painter_role": "save" }
  }
}
